        "query": "| makeresults \n| appendcols [ search index=london_metrics sourcetype=linux:metrics host=ubuntu-london earliest=-15m | stats count as c | eval f0=if(c>0,1,0) | fields f0 ] \n| appendcols [ search index=london_web sourcetype=port:probe host=cat8kv-london earliest=-15m | stats count as c latest(open) as o | eval f1=if(c>0 AND o=1,1,0) | fields f1 ] \n| eval v=if(f0=1 AND f1=1,100,0), status=if(v>=50,\"UP\",\"DOWN\") | table status v",
